name: AWAvenue 原版完整广告策略
desc: 使用 AWAvenue 原版广告规则，将命中流量转发至「🛡️ 廣告攔截」。
author: HJ
category: HJ Stash
rule-providers:
  Repcz-Ads-AWAvenue:
    behavior: classical
    format: text
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Repcz/Tool/X/Stash/Rules/Ads_AWAvenue.list
    path: ./rules/hj-ads-awavenue.list
    interval: 86400
rules:
- RULE-SET,Repcz-Ads-AWAvenue,🛡️ 廣告攔截
